Conduit - third-party notices
=============================

Conduit's own code
------------------
Everything in this repository is Conduit's own work, except the files listed in
section 1. It is licensed under GPL-3.0-or-later; see LICENSE, which also
contains the full GPLv3 text. Conduit contains no source code from ViaVersion,
ViaBackwards, ViaRewind, ViaLegacy, Velocity, BungeeCord, Waterfall or Paper.
Its protocol tables under src/main/resources were generated from data that
Mojang's vanilla server jars emit (see tools/gen_mappings.py).


1. Third-party files in this repository
---------------------------------------
