download them from their upstream repositories onto the machine that builds
Conduit. A Gradle distribution (distZip, distTar or installDist) conveys every
component in the Gradle list below. It carries this file, LICENSE (with the
GPLv3 text) and, under source/, the Corresponding Source for Conduit and for
each GPL component. See docs/LICENSING_VIA.md.

